  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since the rollout of the group feature this year, adding users as moderators requires them to rejoin the instance instead of granting them the moderator powers immediately.\n\nMaybe this is as intended, or something overlooked, or the implementation and work-around currently is too tricky with how instances and permissions work.\n\nExpected:\n\nAdding a user as moderator or removing them as moderator from a group, in an instance hosted via the group, should add or remove the moderator buttons almost instant, when selecting a user in the instance, depending on whether or not they are moderators.\n\nThank you VRC staff.",
